  3→/***************************************************************************
  4→
  5→	KN5000 control panel HLE
  6→
  7→	Emulates the two Mitsubishi M37471M2196S MCUs on the control panel.
  8→
  9→	Protocol Summary:
 10→	-----------------
 11→	- Commands are 2-byte sequences from main CPU
 12→	- Bits 7-5 of command byte select panel (0-3=left, 4-7=right)
 13→	- Response packets have type encoded in bits 5-3:
 14→	    Type 0,1: Button state (bit 6 selects panel: 0=right, 1=left)
 15→	    Type 2: Encoder delta
 16→	    Type 3-5: Sync/ACK
 17→	    Type 6,7: Multi-byte data
 18→
 19→	See: https://felipesanches.github.io/kn5000-docs/control-panel-protocol/
 20→
 21→***************************************************************************/
